        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "4. RECOMMENDATIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        62.36220169067383,
        64.42532348632812,
        368.7563171386719,
        77.61432647705078
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation for use of antibiotics in severe acute malnutrition",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        88.76382446289062,
        375.48406982421875,
        101.95282745361328
      ],
      "text": "4.22\t Antibiotics in management of severe acute malnutrition (SAM)",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        105.38948059082031,
        399.02294921875,
        118.87947845458984
      ],
      "text": "a)\t In children with severe acute malnutrition (SAM) without complications, manage",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        118.38948059082031,
        336.3314208984375,
        131.87948608398438
      ],
      "text": "according to the current community case management guidelines.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        133.7940673828125,
        222.1529083251953,
        147.71408081054688
      ],
      "text": "(Weak Recommendation, expert opnion",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.05873107910156,
        392.6828308105469,
        163.54873657226562
      ],
      "text": "b)\tIn children with SAM with complications, give parenteral antibiotics as follows:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        163.0587921142578,
        399.06134033203125,
        176.54879760742188
      ],
      "text": "­—\t Benzyl penicillin: 50 000 U/kg IM/IV every 6 hours, or ampicillin: 50 mg/kg",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.20469665527344,
        176.0587921142578,
        399.17462158203125,
        189.54879760742188
      ],
      "text": "IM/IV every 6 hours for 2 days, then oral amoxicillin: 15 mg/kg/dose every",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.20469665527344,
        189.05870056152344,
        158.46469116210938,
        202.5487060546875
      ],
      "text": "8  hours for 5 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        202.05870056152344,
        90.1614990234375,
        215.5487060546875
      ],
      "text": "AND",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        215.05870056152344,
        291.6715393066406,
        228.5487060546875
      ],
      "text": "—\t Gentamicin: 7.5 mg/kg IM/IV once daily for 7 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        230.46340942382812,
        249.51284790039062,
        244.3834228515625
      ],
      "text": "(Weak recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        62.36220169067383,
        262.9449157714844,
        328.62823486328125,
        276.1339111328125
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations on Use and Delivery of Oxygen Therapy",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        287.28350830078125,
        288.473876953125,
        300.4725036621094
      ],
      "text": "4.23\t Pulse oximetry for detection of hypoxaemia",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        303.9090881347656,
        399.10296630859375,
        317.39910888671875
      ],
      "text": "Pulse oximetry is recommended to determine the presence of hypoxaemia and to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        316.9090881347656,
        387.7528076171875,
        330.39910888671875
      ],
      "text": "guide administration of oxygen therapy in infants and children with hypoxaemia.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        332.31378173828125,
        252.91282653808594,
        346.2337951660156
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        359.1260070800781,
        332.35296630859375,
        372.31500244140625
      ],
      "text": "4.24\t Clinical signs for detection of hypoxaemia in children",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        375.7516784667969,
        399.07281494140625,
        389.24169921875
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Use pulse oximetry wherever possible for the detection of hypoxaemia in children",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        388.7516784667969,
        399.1214904785156,
        402.24169921875
      ],
      "text": "with severe, lower respiratory infections. If oximetry is not available, then the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        401.7516784667969,
        371.82135009765625,
        415.24169921875
      ],
      "text": "following clinical signs could be used to guide the need for oxygen therapy:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        414.751708984375,
        147.23147583007812,
        428.2417297363281
      ],
      "text": "—\t central cyanosis",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        427.751708984375,
        132.5814971923828,
        441.2417297363281
      ],
      "text": "—\t nasal flaring",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        440.751708984375,
        348.261474609375,
        454.2417297363281
      ],
      "text": "—\t inability to drink or feed (where this is due to respiratory distress)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        453.751708984375,
        191.3915252685547,
        467.2417297363281
      ],
      "text": "—\t grunting with every breath",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        466.751708984375,
        264.78155517578125,
        480.2417297363281
      ],
      "text": "—\t depressed mental state (i.e. drowsy, lethargic)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        482.15631103515625,
        252.91282653808594,
        496.0763244628906
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        498.4208984375,
        399.0729675292969,
        511.9109191894531
      ],
      "text": "b)\tIn some situations and depending on the overall clinical condition, children with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        511.4208984375,
        287.69146728515625,
        524.910888671875
      ],
      "text": "the following less-specific signs may also need oxygen:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        524.4208984375,
        218.01153564453125,
        537.910888671875
      ],
      "text": "—\t severe lower chest wall indrawing",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        537.4208984375,
        222.9415740966797,
        550.910888671875
      ],
      "text": "—\t respiratory rate of 70/min or above",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        550.4208984375,
        138.22149658203125,
        563.910888671875
      ],
      "text": "—\t head nodding",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        565.8256225585938,
        272.92279052734375,
        579.74560546875
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.6383056640625,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.40530395507812,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "19",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}